{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-49cbc400485d7d357a9376af60bc22f0992adcff7d02958d","family_id":"KR:013050","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"ACT ON MANAGEMENT OF FIREFIGHTING EQUIPMENT","title_original":"소방장비관리법","kind":"법률","source_version":"245289","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=245289","source_sha256":"25ba510e1072cf12127e64686af78aaa90cbfc93d07098344d561859f48ffdd9","body_sha256":"f20853653bcacf1fef99cacb6355c5826508b2b7e18aa8403e4dbf17e44a69ac","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 18 (Purchase of Fire Equipment) (1) The head of a fire service agency shall receive documents necessary for purchasing fire equipment from a contractor, supplier or manufacturer, etc., as prescribed by Presidential Decree, for tender notice for purchasing fire equipment, request for submission of a written estimate or conclusion of a contract.\n  (2) The head of a fire service agency shall purchase fire equipment after checking the following:\n  1. Possession standards and service life of fire equipment;\n  2. Commodity classification numbers, name, specifications, and the quantity and time of necessity of fire equipment;\n  3. Other matters prescribed by Presidential Decree.\n  (3) Where the head of a fire service agency acquires fire equipment, not by purchasing pursuant to paragraph (1), he or she shall, without delay, require a public official in charge of management of fire equipment (hereinafter referred to as “public official in charge of management of fire equipment”) to manage the name, specifications, quantity and details of acquisition of the acquired fire equipment.","metadata":{"author_checks":["All current held source unit text, source editorial notes, amounts, periods, exceptions and source omission boundaries compared.","Unchanged official English retained only in the recorded exact source/target spans; original row, role, provider, edition, links and receipts remain unchanged.","New affected units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION / UNREVIEWED; source graphics remain linked to actual unchanged assets.","Source unit keys, order and full-text SHA matched the frozen inventory."],"author_method":"Exact verified reuse of existing official English spans plus assistant-authored corrections/new material, with original rows/roles/receipts preserved.","author_self_check_record":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-18.selfcheck.json","sha256":"43bb265bc52e358a45c77545896e78bf16a645204030366afab3b3c1680f5765"},"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"PARENT:kr-013050-245289-ko","component_ids":["PARENT:kr-013050-245289-ko:article-18"],"component_kind":"PARENT","edition_id":"edition-268cdfdfafba6eacee8db5c7d3085b9e686f73b795eb2770","english_gap_scope_plan":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\direct_ingest_v1\\english_gap_scope_plan_v1.json","reason":{"changes":[{"new_text":"after checking the following:","old_text":"after checking any of the following:","reason":"All required matters must be checked."},{"new_text":"he or she shall, without delay, require a public official in charge","old_text":"he or she shall require a public official in charge","reason":"Restore explicit 지체 없이 requirement."}],"reason":"Source requires checking all listed purchase matters and managing non-purchase acquisitions without delay.","status":"MINIMAL_REPAIR_REQUIRED"},"sha256":"dd2aeb30cb330259f4484b257d488e158de312d85310a6a15ba664da7e6072c7"},"human_or_official_review_claimed":false,"multilingual_schema":"20261018_multilingual_v1","parent_family_id":"KR:013050","parent_ordinal":1521,"payload_scope_id":"PARENT:kr-013050-245289-ko#eng